n":"1"}}],"theme":{}}},{"text":"I've completed the final interactive wiring for your Beltelecom Technician Portal modals. All modal screens now include functional dismiss and submission actions:\n\n### Modal Navigation Details:\n*   **Modal Report**: \n    *   **«Отмена» (Cancel)** and the **backdrop** now navigate back to the **Detail Services** screen.\n    *   **«Послать» (Send)** routes to the **Inbox**, simulating the completion of a report.\n*   **Modal Contacts**: The **«Отмена»** button and **backdrop** return you to **Detail Services**.\n*   **Modal Maps**: The **«Отмена»** button and **backdrop** return you to **Detail Services**.\n*   **Modal Wi-Fi**: The **«Отмена»** button and **backdrop** return you to **Detail Services**.\n\nThe Beltelecom visual language, Russian copy, and technical context have been strictly preserved. You can now test the full modal interaction flow in the prototype preview."},{"suggestion":"Test the prototype flow"},{"suggestion":"Update report form fields"},{"suggestion":"Adjust modal layout styling"}]}